<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Market Strategy & Policy -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Market Strategy & Policy">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Market & Sales Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Strategy Management"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Enable the development of a strategic view of an enterprises existing and desired market-place</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>1.2.1.1</TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>01.01.2001</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Market Strategy & Policy Market Strategy & Policy processes enable the development of a strategic view of an enterprises existing and desired market-place, activities and aims. Market segmentation and analysis is performed, to determine an enterprises target and addressable markets, along with the development of marketing strategies for each market segment or set of target customers. The decision is made as to which markets the enterprise wants or needs to be in, and how it plans to enter or grow in these markets and market segments. This will be achieved through multiple inputs: including Enterprise Strategies, Market Research, Market Analysis.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Gather & Analyze Market Information -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Gather & Analyze Market Information">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Market & Sales Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Strategy Management"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Research market information and develop market forecasts</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>1.2.1.1.1</TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.1.1.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Gather & Analyze Market Information Gather & Analyze Market Information processes develop enterprise and business views of the market, based on the analysis of external and internal information sources. These processes include the establishment and management of relationships with external providers of market information, and the management of internal resources used for providing market information. Methodologies used for developing market forecasts, as well as the development of forecasts, are managed within these processes.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Gather Market Information -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Gather Market Information">
