<rdf:label>Gain Commitment to Marketing Strategy The Gain Commitment to Market Strategy processes gain enterprise commitment to the market strategy and segmentation. These processes include all aspects of identification of stakeholders and negotiation to gain stakeholder approval.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

