<rdf:label>Assess Potential Development & Risk Assess the size of the potential development and its risk. The resources, financing and potential on-going customer commitment to the developed solution are all factors that must be assessed.
Assess the size of the potential development and its risk. The resources, financing and potential on-going sales prospect commitment to the developed solution are all factors that must be assessed.</rdf:label>
