<rdf:label>Analyze Sales Performance Report Sales Performance business activity documents formal account of information on estimates of the total and expected value of sales pipeline. Report Sales Performance allows the organization to view what sales representatives are doing so the business can measure performance. This business activity supports improving the sales strategy.</rdf:label>
