<rdf:label>Select Marketing Communication Delivery Channels Select Marketing Communication Delivery Channels selects the appropriate channel or channels to support delivery of a marketing message associated with a communication. A particular product offering or marketing campaign may require selection of one or several delivery channels.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

