<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Define Market Problem Research Objectives business activity is in charge of establishing objectives relevant and suitable for a market problem research plan.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.1.21.1.2.1.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Define Market Problem Research Objectives Define Market Problem Research Objectives business activity is in charge of establishing objectives relevant and suitable for a market problem research plan. 

This business activity includes tasks that ensure the market problem research objectives are instrumental to developing answers to a market problem.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Develop Market Problem Research Approach -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Develop Market Problem Research Approach">
