<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Develop Market Problem Research Approach business activity is in charge of defining the manner by which to embark on the market problem research.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.1.21.1.2.1.2</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Develop Market Problem Research Approach Develop Market Problem Research Approach business activity is in charge of defining the manner by which to embark on the market problem research. 

This business activity includes tasks that ensure the market problem research plan can apply an effective methodology to the research plan to achieve the research objectives.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Analyze Market Problem Information -->

