<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Market & Sales Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Assurance"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Develop Market Problem Solution business activity is in charge of establishing mediatory activities or solutions to market problems.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.1.21.1.3</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Develop Market Problem Solution Develop Market Problem Solution business activity is in charge of establishing mediatory activities or solutions to market problems. 

Develop Market Problem Solution will include activities that cover, but are not limited to addressing competitiveness, value proposition, brand index, and business models.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Execute Market Problem Solution -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Execute Market Problem Solution">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Market & Sales Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Assurance"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Execute Market Problem Solution business activity is in charge of implementing and administering answers to market problems.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.1.21.1.4</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Execute Market Problem Solution Execute Market Problem Solution business activity is in charge of implementing and administering answers to market problems. 

This business activity leverages 'Develop Market Problem Solution' to inform the optimal approach to use in implementing answers to market problem.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Sales Problem -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Sales Problem">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Market & Sales Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Assurance"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Manage Sales Problem business activity is in charge directing and controlling the handling of issues and pinpoints that affects selling products and services.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.1.21.2</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Manage Sales Problem Manage Sales Problem business activity is in charge directing and controlling the handling of issues and pinpoints that affects selling products and services. 

Manage Sales Problem includes tasks that mange handling of failure in sales strategy, unreliable Sales Pipeline Management, poor sales performance and effectiveness, a lack of sales team focus, misalignment with marketing, and/or poor product/service sales experience.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Define Sales Problem -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Define Sales Problem">
