<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>1.2.1.2.2.1</TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.1.2.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Define Overall Product Portfolios Structure Define overall product portfolios structure processes focus on defining overall structure of product portfolios to be used across the enterprise, or between or within business units. These products and product portfolios form the basis of offers made to customers.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

