<rdf:label>Agree Product Infrastructure Requirements These processes obtain agreement to  the detailed infrastructure requirements to support the product portfolio and individual product plans. The processes include any interaction with cross-enterprise co-ordination and management functions to ensure that the requirements capture the needs of all stakeholders.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

