<rdf:label>Capture Product Capability Shortfalls The Capture Product Capability Shortfalls processes identify specific or imminent product capacity, product performance and/or product operational support shortfalls. These processes take information available from the Customer Relationship Management processes to establish detailed views of anticipated product capacity and performance shortfalls and support process issues.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

