<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Capability Management"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>These processes ensure that all tools, test equipment, operational procedures, support groups, and training is in place to allow for successful operation.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
