<rdf:label>Report Product Performance Analysis Report Product Performance Analysis business activity provides detailed account of research findings and outcome of evaluation of product performance.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Control Product Performance -->

