<rdf:label>Control Product Performance Control Product Performance business activity determine and administer changes and directives the manage product performance accomplishment.  Control Product Performance may establish and manage actions that directly or indirectly impact on products, their impact on customers and ultimately their performance in the market.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Report Product Performance -->

