<rdf:label>Organize Product Catalog Content Entry Organize Product Catalog Content Entry business activity handles Catalog Content organization according to the Product Catalog model.
Organize Catalog Content Entry business activities can include ordering, arranging, sorting, assembling, and grouping.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Classify Product Catalog Content Entry -->

