<rdf:label>Classify Product Catalog Content Entry Classify Product Catalog Content Entry business activity specifically handles Catalog Content organization according to business classification characteristics for the Product Catalog.
Classify Product Catalog Content Entry is specific to shared qualities or characteristics defined by the organization.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Product Catalog Access -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Product Catalog Access">
