<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Create Product Order Shipment Advice business activity is responsible for creating the alert given by the prodict ordr shipper to the product order consignee before arrival of theproduct order.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.27.2.5.1.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Create Product Order Shipment Advice Create Product Order Shipment Advice business activity is responsible for creating the alert given by the prodict ordr shipper to the product order consignee before arrival of theproduct order.

Create Product Order Shipment Advice helps consignees to track product orders.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Schedule Product Order Shipment -->

