<rdf:label>Request Product Order Cancellation Request Product Order Cancellation business activity enables product orders to be dropped or removed from product order processing. 

Request Product Order Cancellation ensures that there is a process in place within the organization product order process to address requests that are legitimate or acceptable by the organizations business rules and policies.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Product Order Cancellation -->

