<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.4.2.1.2</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Agree Service Infrastructure Requirements These processes obtain agreement to  the detailed infrastructure requirements to support the product capabilities required by the enterprise. The processes include any interaction with cross-enterprise coordination and management functions to ensure that the demand distributions capture the needs of all stakeholders.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

