<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Specify Service Capability Infrastructure These processes assess the most appropriate service infrastructure, and develop the tactical/solution architecture and design specifications to be used to build or source the necessary service infrastructure components, to meet the identified service capability requirements.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

