<rdf:label>Co-ordinate Service Operational Handover These processes co-ordinate the processes involved in handover of deployed service infrastructure to operational control, including the management and coordination of all stakeholders required to gain approval and acceptance of the handover.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

