<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Provide management reports and any specialized summaries of the efficiency and effectiveness of the overall Service Configuration & Activation process.  These specialized summaries could be specific reports required by specific audiences.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
