<rdf:label>Maintain Service Catalog Content Relationship Maintain Service Catalog Content Relationship business activity handles associating Service catalog entries.
Catalog Content Relationship for Service catalog entries can be internal and external to the Product, Service or Resource domains.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

