<rdf:label>Classify Service Catalog Content Entry Classify Service Catalog Content Entry business activity specifically handles Catalog Content organization according to business classification characteristics for the Service Catalog.
Classify Service Catalog Content Entry is specific to shared qualities or characteristics defined by the organization.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Service Catalog Access -->

