<rdf:label>Manage Service Catalog Access Manage Service Catalog Access business activity handles access to the catalog according to the Catalog Content Management standards and policies.
Manage Service Catalog Access will handle assigning catalog managers and granting privileges.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

