<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Strategy Management"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Accept changing resource requirements and develop resource strategies</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>1.2.3.1.3.2</TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.5.1.3.2</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Develop Resource Strategy Develop resource Strategy processes, accept the changing of resource requirements and develop appropriate resource strategies and strategic resource architectures based on the changing needs of the enterprise, and increasing expectations of  the markets. Develop resource strategy may perform in-parallel across all required resources proactively.
Today in digital ecosystem, Digital resource architecture map could help to facilitate this process.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

