<rdf:label>Remove Resource Work Order Task Remove Resource Work Order Task business activity is to remove a task from a resource work order. 

Remove Resource Work Order Task business activity includes identifying the task to be removed, removing the task from all relevant references, and communicating the removal to relevant parties.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Analyze Resource Work Order Tasks -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Analyze Resource Work Order Tasks">
