<rdf:label>Monitor Resource Capacity Monitor Resource Capacity business activity identifies relevant resource capacity attributes/properties, and monitors and tracks all attributes, their use, and changes.
 Monitor Resource Capacity supports all activities of Resource Capacity Management by providing timely visibility for all concerns around Resource Capacity</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Report Resource Capacity -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Report Resource Capacity">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
