<rdf:label>Classify Resource Catalog Content Entry Classify Resource Catalog Content Entry business activity specifically handles Catalog Content organization according to business classification characteristics for the Resource Catalog.
Classify Resource Catalog Content Entry is specific to shared qualities or characteristics defined by the organization.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Resource Catalog Access -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Resource Catalog Access">
