<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Identify the most appropriate Business Partner or parties amongst those with whom an appropriate agreement exists.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>1.0.7.6.1</TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.6.8.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Select External Business Partner for Business Partner Order The responsibility of the Select External Business Partner processes is to identify the most appropriate external Business Partner or parties amongst those with whom an appropriate agreement exists.
Based on the particular product, service and/or resource requirements, select the most appropriate Business Partner from the range of parties with whom a agreement exists.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

