<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Remove a specification that represents a method by which a payment may be made by a Business Partner by changing its effective date or physically removing it.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
