<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Manage Enterprise Catalog Management Standard activity identify and promulgate rules and references for managing conformity of Catalogs for information integrity across the enterprises catalogs.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>X.X.X.X.X.X</TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.7.1.7.2</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Enterprise Capacity Management Requirement Enterprise Capacity Management Requirement business activity help to identify and deal with the Enterprises demand program to support any and all of the value streams, including products, service and resources altogether.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

