<rdf:label>Manage Enterprise Catalog Strategy Manage Enterprise Catalog Strategy business activity directs and controls the definition of the overarching Catalog Management strategy for the organization. 

Manage Enterprise Catalog Strategy business activity include activities to oversee all Catalog Management in the organization and with its subsidiaries, Catalog Management Integration and Catalog Management implementation between and across functions and operating subsidiaries.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

