<rdf:label>Enterprise Audit & Risk Management Enterprise Audit & Risk Management business process directs and controls activities that assess the enterprises compliance and consistency in performance of activities against regulations and internal policies, and  as well manage the understanding and addressing of enterprise business risks. 
Enterprise Audit & Risk Management address needs of all enterprise business functions and activities with enterprise audit management and enterprise risk management.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Enterprise Audit -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Enterprise Audit">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Enterprise Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG."/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Enterprise Audit Management business activity directs and controls the assessment, evaluation and reporting on the enterprises state of compliance,  according to regulations and internal policies, by way of its day-to-day of activities while checking and reporting consistency operating against established directives.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.7.2.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Manage Enterprise Audit Manage Enterprise Audit business activity directs and controls the assessment, evaluation and reporting on the enterprises state of compliance,  according to regulations and internal policies, by way of its day-to-day of activities while checking and reporting consistency operating against established directives.  

Manage Enterprise Audit helps simplify and well-organize the workflow and collaboration process of compiling and reporting of audits and their findings. The business activity provide assurance to senior management and the enterprise Board that the business processes and controls are effective and conform to relevant directives and applicable standards.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Define Audit Policy -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Define Audit Policy">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Enterprise Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG."/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Define the audit policies and procedures
Defines the audit policies and procedures. It will depend on the type of audit like but not limited to Risk audit, Data Management, Data Governance Audit etc.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
