<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Provide assurance to senior management and the enterprise Board that the enterprise operational processes and controls are effective and conform to relevant adopted standards (which may be externally imposed or internally adopted). Audit Management proces</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
