<rdf:label>Create Workforce Strategy Define the competencies and skills required of the human resources; create the strategies needed to ensure that the correct type, quantity and quality of employees will be available in right locations for future business.  and define the competencies and skills required of the human resources</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

