<rdf:label>Develop Stock/Inventory Management Policy Develop Stock/Inventory Management Policy business activity develop the corporate policies, in conjunction with Asset Management processes which provide the inventory information resource, relating to locations of, and levels of, stock/inventory holdings.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Procurement -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Procurement">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Enterprise Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG."/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Manage Procurement business activity is in charge of all acquisition tasks for supplies needed by the organization (including raw materials/resources, services, finished products) for business operations.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.7.10.3</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Manage Procurement Manage Procurement business activity handle all acquisition tasks for supplies needed by the organization (including raw materials/resources, services, finished products) for business operations.
Through Manage Procurement business activities, the evaluation, selection, and creation of formal contractual agreements, as well as managing the organizations ongoing supplier relationships are done.
Manage Procurement activity interrelates with Financial Management business process when there is need to oversee transactional purchasing of supplies (goods and services), in order to complete a Source-to-Settle cycle.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

