<rdf:label>Formulate Enterprise Privacy Policy Formulate Enterprise Privacy Policy process provides the organization the ability to formulate Privacy Policies in a way that assures it business interests with the understanding and consideration of all statutory and regulatory mandates.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

