<rdf:label>Track Asset Track Asset business activity monitor all assets, their movements, value and state based on established asset lifecycle management.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Decommission Asset -->

