<rdf:label>Manage Enterprise Business Rules Performance Manage Business Rules Performance business activity is in charge of directing and controlling effect of business rules on enterprise performance.
Managing Business Rules performance ensure that business rules are framed as a precise statement defining a term, fact, and a constraint. Manage Business Rules Performance support enterprise performance management formats are as  declarative as possible.</rdf:label>
