<rdf:label>Manage Enterprise Performance Consolidation, Reconciliation and Close Manage Enterprise Performance Consolidation, Reconciliation and Close' is a compound business activity that involves managing the consolidation, reconciliation and close activities altogether in accordance to the enterprises' performance management requirement for both internal and external statutory needs.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Performance Activity Consolidation -->

