<rdf:label>Manage Information & Data Lifecycle Manage Information & Data Lifecycle business activity is in charge of defining the enterprises plan and approach to direct and control Information and data across a life cycle that is consistent from creation to final disposition. 

Manage Information & Data Lifecycle business activities supports managing control over information and data in the enterprise.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Information & Data Archival -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Information & Data Archival">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
