<rdf:label>Manage Information & Data Disposal Manage Information & Data Disposal business activity is in charge of directing and controlling term and manner in which information and data is destroyed. 

Manage Information & Data Disposal business activity include tasks that ensure disposal of information and data is irreversible - with no chance of recovery.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Program -->

