<rdf:label>Manage Program Manage Program business activity maps, directs and controls programs to align with the enterprises business objectives and support organizational performance. 

Manage Program oversees and coordinates the various projects and strategic initiatives throughout the organization.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Design Program -->

