<rdf:label>Design Program Vision & Goals Design Program Vision & Goals business activity is in charge of setting the program vision, program goals and course of action for programs.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Formulate Program -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Formulate Program">
