<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Formulate Program business activity is in charge of choosing the who, what, how, when, and where of pursuing program objectives according to program vision and goals.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
