<rdf:label>Formulate Program Formulate Program business activity is in charge of choosing the who, what, how, when, and where of pursuing program objectives according to program vision and goals.

Formulate Program business activity include tasks that define project specifications, provide framework for different projects to share similar overall objectives in coordinated manner.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Program Delivery -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Program Delivery">
