<rdf:label>Manage Project Mange Project business activity is in charge of directing and controlling all responsibilities for activities involved in executing, reporting and closing projects according to program goals. 

Manage Project business activity includes tasks that help to lead the work of a team to achieve all project goals within the given constraints.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Initiate Project -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Initiate Project">
