<rdf:label>Initiate Project Initiate Project business activity handle tasks that are performed to define a new project according to an enterprises program vision and goals.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Plan Project -->

