<rdf:label>Close Project Close Project business activity handle tasks that finalize all work and actions across all Manage Project activities to formally bring a project to an end.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Transition Project -->

