<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Communicate Procedure business activity is in charge of sharing or exchanging information on the existence and 'how to' of well-defined course/plan of performing activities (e.g. workflows) with parties concerned or having interest in a procedure.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.7.14.7.2.2</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Communicate Procedure Communicate Procedure business activity is in charge of sharing or exchanging information on the existence and 'how to' of well-defined course/plan of performing activities (e.g. workflows) with parties concerned or having interest in a procedure.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

