<rdf:label>Ensure Community Visibility Responsible for ensuring the enterprises position within the community, or communities, within which it operates. This includes local activities with, and financial and other support for, schools, libraries, hospitals, emergency services, etc.; concern for the immediate environment; visibility at local events; etc.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

